<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1520_5479.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlicher</unclear> grueß
<lb n="2"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>, Ersam
<lb n="3"/>Weise, liebe <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachbarn</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euwre</unclear> vielfaltige <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schreiben</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">namen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ewers</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Insaßen</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lienhard</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Brisingers</unclear></persName>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßelben</unclear> haußfrauwen
<lb n="6"/>abgangen, haben wir empfangen, auß dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">letsten</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>aber mit ettwas befrömbden verstanden, daß
<lb n="8"/>ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> fürbilden, und zum theil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darauf</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deuten</unclear>,
<lb n="9"/>alß wann gemelter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Brisinger</unclear> oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßelben</unclear> hauß-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frauw</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möge</unclear> zu einem erb komen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> iro
<lb n="11"/>in unser Statt zuogfallen, und nach vermög unsers
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbrechtens</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">albereit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuekennt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/>sein sölte. Und geben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> hierauf in
<lb n="14"/>antwurt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hinwiderumb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvernemmen</unclear>, daß
<lb n="15"/>ir hierunder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ettwas</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">milt</unclear> sind berichtet
<lb n="16"/>worden. Dann wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear> weder von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einichem</unclear> erb-
<lb n="17"/>fall, der in unser Statt deß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorgenanten</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bri</unclear>-
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">singers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haußfrauwen</unclear> zuogfallen, noch daß iro der-
<lb n="19"/>selbig, laut unser Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesatztem</unclear> erbrechten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear>-
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kennt</unclear> worden seye. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sonsten</unclear>, so dem also
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">were</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllen</unclear> ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> der vernunfft und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bscheidenheit</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>wüssen, daß wir eben so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> und willig
<lb n="23"/>seyen, menigclichem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frömbd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heimbsch</unclear> zu seinem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befügten</unclear> rechten
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverhelffen</unclear>: alß ir nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> selbs <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rüemen</unclear>, ir
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölches</unclear> bißher in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euwer</unclear> Statt auch gethon, und die
<lb n="26"/>erbfähige, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieselben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seyen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erben</unclear> zugelassen habind.
<lb n="27"/>Gleichwol ist nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohne</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weissen</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>zwar wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuerinnern</unclear>, daß nach dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weylund</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewesne</unclear> burgerin, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frauw</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Maria <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Weylin</unclear></persName>,
<lb n="30"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hubein</unclear></persName>, weiland <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Joachim</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Straßbergs</unclear></persName> seligen, hinder-
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">witib</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jüngster</unclear> tagen, durch den willen
<lb n="32"/>Gottes mit tod abgangen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemelten</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Brisinger</unclear></persName>
<lb n="33"/>an statt seiner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haußfrauwen</unclear>, sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alßbald</unclear> alß
<lb n="34"/>ein erb angemaßt, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daßjenige</unclear>, waß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besagte</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1520_5480.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frauw</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Maria <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Weilenhuberin</unclear></persName> selig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gedachts</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">irs</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehewuirts</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Joachim <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gaißbergs</unclear></persName> seligen wegen in
<lb n="37"/>leibgedings weiß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jnngehept</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zubeziechen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">under</unclear>-
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">standen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Alß</unclear> im aber solches von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear>
<lb n="39"/>burgern rechtlich widersprochen worden, mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuir</unclear>-
<lb n="40"/>wendung, daß sy vom gebluet neher alß deß <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buichsingers</unclear></persName>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haußfrauw</unclear>, und namlich mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorgemeltem</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gaißberg</unclear></persName>
<lb n="42"/>seligen rechte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschwuisterigte</unclear> kind seyen. Habend wir
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hieruf</unclear> (. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear> erachtens .) dem rechten und aller
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billichkait</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemaeß</unclear>, Jme <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buichsinger</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uferlegt</unclear>,
<lb n="45"/>daß er zu recht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnugsam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beibringen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erweisen</unclear>
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selle</unclear>, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nohe</unclear> sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haußfrauw</unclear>, mehrgedachtem
<lb n="47"/><persName resp="#ner">Joachim <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Geißberg</unclear></persName> seligen mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bluetfreündtschafft</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zugethan</unclear> und verwandt gewesen seye: Und
<lb n="49"/>so hierunder sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befünde</unclear>, daß dieselb sein
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haußfrauw</unclear> umb ein grad <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weiter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">were</unclear>, alß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear>
<lb n="51"/>allhiesige ansprechende burger, und also sy <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buichsingerin</unclear></persName>
<lb n="52"/>an irer muter seligen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> zuerben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anstehn</unclear> wolte:
<lb n="53"/>Daß alßdann er <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Buichsinger</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear>, von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear>, ein urkund
<lb n="54"/>bringen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selle</unclear>, daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uf</unclear> zutragenden fall, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear>
<lb n="55"/>burger, bey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> in gleichem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">casu</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> also zuerben
<lb n="56"/>zugelassen werdind. Mit dem anhang, daß wir
<lb n="57"/>die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">partheyen</unclear> alßdann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beiderseits</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">entscheiden</unclear>
<lb n="58"/>wellen. Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierzu</unclear> haben wir ime <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buichsinger</unclear></persName>
<lb n="59"/>nit nur einen, sonder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zween</unclear> oder drey termin,
<lb n="60"/>auch zeit, weil und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">blatz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnugsam</unclear> gelassen,
<lb n="61"/>also, daß er hierunder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainiches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkuirtzt</unclear>
<lb n="62"/>noch übereilt worden. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> nun
<lb n="63"/>aber vilgedachter <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buichsinger</unclear></persName>, nit allein deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeregt</unclear>
<lb n="64"/>auch nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwisen</unclear>, daß sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haußfrauw</unclear> so nahe,
<lb n="65"/>oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eins</unclear> grads weiter, alß die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alhiesige</unclear> erben,
<lb n="66"/>verwandt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seye</unclear>, auch daß ime <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uferlegt</unclear> urkund
<lb n="67"/>nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußbringen</unclear> mögen, sonder anders nichts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">für</unclear>-
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">derbrocht</unclear>, dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear> sein <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buichsingers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schweiger</unclear>, und
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1520_5481.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="69"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mergemelter</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Joachim</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gaißberg</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seliger</unclear>, zu <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-7" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Costantz</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="70"/>und daß der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gaißberg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> mit und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nebent</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einanderen</unclear>, zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear>-
<lb n="71"/>sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wib</unclear> die <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Widmerin</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelassen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gaißberg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wib</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Widmerin</unclear>,
<lb n="72"/>bey irem leben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geredt</unclear>, daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gaißberg</unclear> ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beserers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buisingers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haußfrauw</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gaißberg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beserers</unclear>
<lb n="73"/>zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erben</unclear> habe, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weliches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Joachim</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gaißberg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seligen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nahe</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habe</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weliches</unclear>
<lb n="74"/>alles wir wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muegend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grad</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">witer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesipt</unclear> seye, alß die alhiesige <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alles</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muegend</unclear>
<lb n="75"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glauben</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Darauß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angenemeste</unclear> erben: Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uber</unclear> daß, in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwebender</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glauben</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Darauß</unclear>
<lb n="76"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volget</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear>, diser handlung, sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befindet</unclear>, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volget</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear>,
<lb n="77"/>alhie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geseßne</unclear> burger, in der linien deß gebluets
<lb n="78"/>die neheren gewesen: So haben auß krafft
<lb n="79"/>unsers <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lauteren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erbrechtens</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> die
<lb n="80"/>nehere zu erben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ingsezt</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dasessen</unclear>
<lb n="81"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haußfrauwen</unclear> alß die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">witere</unclear>, darvon abge-
<lb n="82"/>wisen. Und in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solichem</unclear> allem, gegen dem
<lb n="83"/>eüweren kein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neüwerung</unclear> (. wie aber ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear>
<lb n="84"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergebenlich</unclear> und ohne grund <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inbilden</unclear> .) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerge</unclear>-
<lb n="85"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nomen</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sonderen</unclear> anders nichts alß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> daß,
<lb n="86"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> unser verschriben erbrecht und die billich-
<lb n="87"/>keit an ir selbs mitbringt, gethan und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="88"/>handlet, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhoffenlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> solches wol gegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">got</unclear>,
<lb n="89"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wëlt</unclear> und aller <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbarkeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverantwuorten</unclear>
<lb n="90"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wuessen</unclear>. Daß wolten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear>,
<lb n="91"/>zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerantwuort</unclear>, und damit ir diser sachen
<lb n="92"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grundtlichen</unclear> bericht haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>, nit verhalten.
<lb n="93"/>Und sind <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sunsten</unclear> zu nachbarlichem willen
<lb n="94"/>wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewogen</unclear>. Datum den <origDate when="1580-10-21" resp="#ner">21. octobris a° <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">1580</unclear></origDate>
<lb n="95"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">B. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhate</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear>
<lb n="96"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="97"/>Den ersamen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wisen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-102" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadtaman</unclear> und rhat
<lb n="98"/>zu Arbon</orgName> unseren sonders lieben nachbarn.
